Supreme court of Nepal has issued a notice regarding the senior advocate &amp; advocate. The notice mentioned that, "all the senior advocate need to include an advocate with him/her compulsorily in the bench while presenting oral argument." As our <strong>Rules of Professional Code of Conduct of Legal Practitioners, 2079 (2023) </strong>Section 6(a) stated Senior advocates should include at least one additional advocate for professional assistance while presenting oral arguments before the Bench in any case.

